INTERVIEW ANSWER
----------------
I built an Autonomous AI SRE Copilot using CrewAI, Temporal, Redis, Qdrant, FastAPI, Kubernetes, and ArgoCD. The platform uses Investigator, Planner, and Executor agents to automate incident investigation and remediation. Redis provides short-term memory, Qdrant stores historical incidents, Temporal orchestrates workflows, and Langfuse plus DeepEval provide observability and evaluation.

